OL,3,ARobert Pattinson named as new James
OL,4,ABond, ending long hunt for Daniel
OL,5,ACraig's replacement
OL,6,
OL,7,FRobert Pattinson has been named as the
OL,8,Fnew James Bond - here's an image of the
OL,9,Factor in the role, released on social
OL,10,Fmedia
OL,12,FIn a statement, the 40-year-old British
OL,13,Factor says: "To say this role is a
OL,14,Fdream come true is an understatement"
OL,16,FPeaky Blinders creator Steven Knight
OL,17,Fhas been writing the script for the new
OL,18,Ffilm, with Denis Villeneuve due to
OL,19,Fdirect - we don't yet know a release
OL,20,Fdate
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
