OL,3,ARobert Pattinson named as new James
OL,4,ABond, ending long hunt for Daniel
OL,5,ACraig's replacement
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn May, Amazon MGM Studios announced
OL,8,Fthe casting process was under way after
OL,9,Ftaking control of the franchise
OL,11,FSpeculation about who would replace
OL,12,FDaniel Craig has been rife, with actors
OL,13,Fincluding Josh O'Connor, Callum Turner
OL,14,Fand Jack Lowden reported to have made
OL,15,Fit to the final screen tests
OL,17,FThanking those who auditioned,
OL,18,FVilleneuve says "we were surrounded by
OL,19,Fextraordinary talent" - and that
OL,20,FPattinson "has the timeless soul of
OL,21,F007"
